<https://cair-nepal.org/heritagegraph/HereditaryRoleTenure> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote> "Design note: PROV placement: a prov:Entity, i.e. a thing whose provenance is tracked (sources, attributions, assertions about it), and a crm:E4_Period (stated, 1.1.0). A period is not a crm:E7_Activity, so the class stays outside any E7 ⊑ prov:Activity alignment and the PROV-O Entity/Activity disjointness is not engaged; reasoning with CIDOC-CRM, CRMinf, CRMsci and PROV-O loaded is consistent with the example data."@en .
